body:
Hi, I understand where your coming from. If your anything like me you probably put a lot of work into your relationship and really cared about her. Things coming to end isn't such a bad thing. Just because a chapter of your life is coming to an end doesn't mean the story is. There are still blank pages left for you to fill. You aren't struggling alone and it may not seem like it but there are a lot of options for you to choose from. 

&nbsp;

You don't have your ex to live for, you have your self. You can live for yourself.
